@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Ping
GET {{baseUrl}}/ping

### Get keys for a user on a host
GET {{baseUrl}}/keys/server1.example.com/mark

### Add a key for a user on a host
POST {{baseUrl}}/keys/server1.example.com/mark
Content-Type: text/plain

ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIBcCzNrDr3gvnYGrWO5tAcgVJI7IXPEnGNlZW+UcE7vF mark@laptop

### Remove a key (replace keyId with actual GUID from add response)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/keys/server1.example.com/mark/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
